<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <picture>
    <source srcset="/cycanic-full.webp" type="image/webp" />
    <img class="about-fig" src="/cycanic-full.png" width="453" height="900" alt="" />
  </picture>
  <p>This workshop connects <strong>cybernetics</strong>, how machines steer themselves, with <strong>mechanics</strong>,
  how they're built and how they build. Its machines are AI agents and the tools around them: built here, opened up,
  measured, and published with the numbers and the code.</p>
  <p>New articles and releases appear here, on <a href="/repos/">Repos</a> and in the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
  <p>Questions and corrections: open an issue in the relevant repository on <a href="https://github.com/cycanics">GitHub</a>.</p>
</Base>
